1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,720
(Leonard:)Sheldon, let's go!

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,790
To a hospital?!

3
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:06,320
Full of sick people?!

4
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:09,600
(Sheldon:)Oh, I don't think so.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,600
(Penny:)Okay, well, your friend and his
mother are there, we're going.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,430
(Sheldon:)I can't.

7
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,770
(Penny:)Oh, don't tell me you're
afraid of germs.

8
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:20,070
(Sheldon:)Not all germs.

9
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:22,470
(Sheldon:)Just the ones that will kill me.

10
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:25,080
(Sheldon:)It's the same way I'm not
afraid of all steak knives--

11
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:27,980
(Sheldon:)just the ones that might be
plunged in my thorax.

12
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,610
(Leonard:)Fine, I'll tell Howard
you didn't come

13
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:31,650
(Leonard:)because you're more concerned

14
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,020
(Leonard:)about your own well-being
than his.

15
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,850
(Sheldon:)I would think
he would know that.

16
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,320
(Penny:)Okay, you know what?
You are unbelievable.

17
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,990
(Penny:)You buy all these
superhero T-shirts,

18
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,330
(Penny:)but when it's time for you

19
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:43,790
(Penny:)to step up
and do the right thing,

20
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,700
(Penny:)you just hide
in the laundry room.

21
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,530
(Sheldon:)Fine, I'll go.

22
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:52,800
(Sheldon:)Just for the record,
my Aunt Ruth died in a hospital.

23
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,070
(Sheldon:)She went in to
visit my Uncle Roger,

24
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,570
(Sheldon:)caught something and bit
the dust a week later.

